      "no_growth": "The expanded tree holds exactly as many examples as the clean one, paired example_id for example_id: expansion creates no fragments and no clusters, so effective sample size is identical in every cell. A difference between two cells can therefore only be robustness to paraphrase; it can never be better coverage.",
